OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder after shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDestiny Ema, 23, of Meadgate Avenue,
OL,7,FChelmsford, Kayden Brown, 18, of Noaks
OL,8,FAvenue, Chelmsford, and a 17-year-old
OL,9,Ffrom Braintree who cannot be named for
OL,10,Flegal reasons are due to appear at
OL,11,FChelmsford Magistrates' Court on
OL,12,FMonday.
